\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S1}{\ignorespaces \textbf {Train versus test performance comparison.} Test set performance (30\% held out) is reported for all tissues. Train set metrics are not shown as models were evaluated only on held-out data to prevent overfitting.}}{123}{table.caption.19}%
